{"ticker":"ROL","updated":"2026-10-30T23:10:15Z","profile":{"longName":"Rollins, Inc.","shortName":"Rollins, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Personal Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.rollins.com","fullTimeEmployees":22000,"marketCap":16676499456,"trailingPE":31.798164,"forwardPE":28.069096,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.182107,"pegRatio":3.1,"targetMeanPrice":37.23529,"targetHighPrice":46.0,"targetLowPrice":26.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":17,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.062,"earningsGrowth":-0.023,"grossMargins":0.52139,"operatingMargins":0.20562,"profitMargins":0.13194,"totalRevenue":3987582976,"beta":0.731,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":66.14,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":29.29,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.31},"summary":"Rollins, Inc., through its subsidiaries, provides pest and wildlife control services and protection to residential and commercial customers in the United States and internationally. The company offers pest control services to residential properties protecting from common pests, including rodents, insects, and wildlife. It also provides workplace pest control solutions for customers across various end markets, such as healthcare, food service, and logistics. In addition, the company offers termite protection and ancillary services for both residential and commercial customers. It serves clients directly, as well as through franchisee operations. The company was formerly known as Rollins Broadcasting, Inc and changed its name to Rollins, Inc. in 1965. Rollins, Inc. was founded in 1901 and is headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia.","summary_zh":"羅林斯公司透過其子公司為美國和國際上的住宅和商業客戶提供害蟲和野生動物防治服務和保護。該公司為住宅物業提供害蟲防治服務，以防止常見害蟲，包括囓齒動物、昆蟲和野生動物。它還為醫療保健、食品服務和物流等各個終端市場的客戶提供工作場所害蟲防治解決方案。此外，該公司也為住宅和商業客戶提供白蟻防護和輔助服務。它直接為客戶提供服務，也透過特許經營業務為客戶提供服務。該公司前身為 Rollins Broadcasting, Inc，於 1965 年更名為 Rollins, Inc.。 Rollins, Inc. 成立於 1901 年，總部位於喬治亞州亞特蘭大。","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"個人服務","candles":[{"t":"20